# Generated e2e media (tests/media/), produced by that directory's
# `regenerate.sh`. The root .prettierignore carries this too, but that one only
# applies to `pnpm format:check` at the root; `pnpm --filter triiiceratops
# format` runs `prettier --write .` from here. The waveform files must stay
# byte-identical to real `audiowaveform` output — reflowing `tone.json` would
# make ticket 10's parsers assert our own reading of the format back at us —
# and the HLS segments are MPEG-TS bytes in `.ts` files, which Prettier parses
# as TypeScript and chokes on.
